🟢 User Story – Community Park
As a visitor of the community park,
I want to have clean, safe, accessible, and well-signposted facilities,
so that I can enjoy a pleasant recreational space with my family and friends.
📝 Description
The community park should provide a safe and comfortable environment for people of all ages, including children, teenagers, adults, and senior citizens.
Green areas, playgrounds, sports courts, walking paths, and rest areas must be kept in good condition, with constant cleaning and visible signage that makes it easy to navigate within the park.
✅ Acceptance Criteria
Common areas must be clean and free of trash.
Clear signage must be available to locate playgrounds, restrooms, courts, and exits.
Facilities must be in good condition and free of hazards.
Safe and adequate access must be available for people with disabilities.
Recreational areas must receive regular maintenance.
🎯 Benefit
Improves the visitor experience, encourages family interaction, promotes physical activity, and strengthens the care of public spaces.